          "description": "Take to the skies with the PAW Patrol in five action-filled stories. Whenever there's trouble up high above Adventure Bay, Skye, Chase, Rubble, Zuma, Rocky, and Marshall are ready for action! From daring mid-air rescues to swooping stunts through the clouds, no job is too big, no pup is too small!      \n\nStories include:    \n- Pups Save the Airport Opening   \n- Pups Stop a Rocket-Powered Pogo Stick    \n- Pups Save the Sky-High Stunt Show   \n- Pups vs the Hum-Cloud   \n- Pups Stop the Mid-Air Magnet",
          "author": "PAW Patrol",
